# Vercel builds dist/ itself (see buildCommand in vercel.json), so the build
# inputs — src/, build.mjs, sprite.mjs — MUST ship. Only things the build and
# the host never touch are excluded.
node_modules
.DS_Store
*.log

# Docs and research — not part of the app
BUILD.md
README.md
PLAYBOOK-RESEARCH.md
research.md

# One-off design-review artefacts (~20MB) and brand hand-off packages
report
handoff
handoff-build.mjs
Clavia brand and motion
*.zip

# Local-only tooling
dev-server.mjs
export-reviews.py
